        "id": 66470,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-23T23:21:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Bunker is one of my favs, and I usually don't have any problems with him. The restrictions on Turret Mode and Recharge Mode are usually worth the benefits. The only card of his I'm not very fond of is Upgrade Mode, and that's simply because you have to wait a whole round before you can benefit from it while losing use of your powers.</p>",
