        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-24T01:05:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We use a few.</p><p>Akash starts with 1 primeval limb.</p><p>Gloomweaver zombies have H hitpoints.</p><p>All of Ambuscade's trap cards play the top card of the villain deck after you arm them.</p>",
