        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-24T13:20:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Having Ambuscade play a card after arming a trap works really well. &nbsp;It makes him a touch harder, and gets the deck moving to make the trap more of a threat.</p>",
