      {
        "id": 66475,
        "name": "p.d.magnus",
        "username": "p.d.magnus",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-08T01:27:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sefirit wrote: \"With this setup he can go into turett mode early and still continue playing cards.\"</p><p>This would be madly overpowered, especially if he has Ammo Drop in play in a target rich environment.</p><p>As written, Turret Mode is plenty powerful. With almost any two equipment cards in play, the ability to use two powers at +1 damage is awesome.</p>",
